---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: /invest/
title: Invest
description: Inspire Carolina, Inc. and LYNK Robotics rely on business partners and community members to give students this opportunity. Here is how to invest.
socialImage: /assets/img/hero/invest.jpg
---

<section class="hero">
  <img class="hero__media" src="/assets/img/hero/invest.jpg" alt="" width="1800" height="1200" fetchpriority="high" />
  <div class="hero__scrim"></div>
  <div class="hero__content">
    <h1>Invest</h1>
    <a class="btn" href="{{ site.links.donate }}" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Invest Now</a>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--center">
  <div class="section__inner">
    <p class="lede prose prose--center">
      As a non-profit organization, Inspire Carolina, Inc. &amp; LYNK Robotics
      rely on the generosity of our business partners and community members in
      order to be able to provide this incredible opportunity to the students on
      our team, and to complete outreach events in our community.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--alt">
  <div class="section__inner">
    <div class="split split--top">
      <div class="stack">
        <h2>Here’s how you can easily make an investment</h2>
        <p>
          Checks can be made out to either “Inspire Carolina, Inc.” or to “Lynk
          Robotics”. If you would like to direct your giving to a particular
          program, please note that on the memo of your check, or in an
          accompanying letter. We take care to honor the generosity of our
          investors by respecting their wishes regarding the use of any donated
          funds. We would also be happy to follow up with you to share about the
          impact of your investment.
        </p>
        <p>
          If you would like to invest to support our activities, you may mail a
          check to: {{ site.contact.mailingAddress }}.
        </p>
        <p>
          For tax and verification purposes, please note that our IRS EIN is
          {{ site.contact.ein }}.
        </p>
        <a class="btn" href="{{ site.links.donate }}" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Invest Now</a>
      </div>

      <div class="media-frame">
        <img
          src="/assets/img/invest/investor-levels.jpg"
          alt="Investor levels: Peak ($15,000+), Overlook ($5,000 up to $15,000), Trailhead ($1,000 up to $5,000) and Gorge (up to $1,000), each with escalating recognition on season shirts, the robot, our website and social media."
          width="1100"
          height="1085"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="section__inner">
    <div class="split split--top">
      <div class="media-frame">
        <img
          src="/assets/img/invest/fundraising-tracker.jpg"
          alt="Fundraising tracker showing a $240,000 goal for the season, broken into lodging, food, sustainability, brand and offseason projects, field elements, robot and registration."
          width="900"
          height="1324"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </div>

      <div class="stack">
        <h2>Current Needs</h2>

        <h3>The LYNK Robotics Team Mobile Pit/Workshop</h3>
        <p>
          For those who would like to partner with us towards a specific goal,
          our current big need is to establish a mobile workshop with all the
          necessary tools for robot development and maintenance, organized and
          packaged in a way that we can both work from it on a regular basis and
          take it to events.
        </p>
        <p>
          <a href="https://drive.google.com/file/d/14gt_5uRFQHJh6OftBqk-OGX7NEHP5Y0F/view" rel="noopener" target="_blank">
            Read the mobile workshop proposal (Google Drive)
          </a>
        </p>

        <h3>2026 REBUILT presented by Haas</h3>
        <p>
          You could also sponsor our FIRST Robotics Competition events that we’ll
          be attending, which involves costs for registration, travel, lodging,
          etc. Currently, we plan to compete in:
        </p>
        <ul>
          {%- for ev in events.competitions %}
            {%- if not ev.conditional %}
              <li>
                {{ ev.start | prettyDate }}–{{ ev.end | prettyDate }} in
                <a href="{{ ev.url }}" rel="noopener" target="_blank">{{ ev.city }}</a>
              </li>
            {%- endif %}
          {%- endfor %}
        </ul>
        <p>{{ events.qualifierNote }}</p>
        <ul>
          <li>
            April 9–12 North Carolina
            <a href="https://frc-events.firstinspires.org/2026/NCCMP" rel="noopener" target="_blank">State Championship</a>
          </li>
          <li>
            April 29–May 2
            <a href="https://www.firstchampionship.org" rel="noopener" target="_blank">World Championship</a>
            in Houston, TX
          </li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          Please <a href="mailto:{{ site.contact.email }}">contact us</a> if you
          would like to discuss full or partial sponsorship of events.
        </p>

        <h3>In-Kind Services and Items</h3>
        <p>
          In no particular order, below is a list of in-kind services and items
          that we’ve identified as top priority:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>Tools for our machining lab</li>
          <li>Robot materials</li>
          <li>Outreach materials (printing, etc.)</li>
          <li>Manufacturing assistance</li>
          <li>Accounting services</li>
          <li>Legal services</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          Please <a href="mailto:{{ site.contact.email }}">contact us</a> if you
          would like to make an in-kind donation.
        </p>
        <p><strong>We’d be delighted to partner with you!</strong></p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="btn-row" style="margin-top: 2.5rem">
      <a class="btn" href="{{ site.links.donate }}" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Invest Now</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

